### Login als susi (Rolle user) - Token wird in {{token}} gespeichert
POST http://localhost:8080/security/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "susi",
  "password": "passme"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body); %}

### Info zum aktuellen Token
GET http://localhost:8080/security/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Students lesen -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ohne Token -> 401
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### Als susi anlegen -> 403 (nur admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "userid": "it1000", "firstname": "Gerald", "lastname": "Aistleitner" }
